arbeitnow:senior-global-manager-enterpri:
&lt;div class="content-intro"&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Our Global Structure&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;Deliveroo is now part of DoorDash, bringing together teams with even greater reach, scale, and ambition. Depending on your role, you may collaborate with teammates, systems, and leaders across DoorDash and Wolt. Together, we’re unlocking new possibilities as one global team.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h2 data-path-to-node="0"&gt;&lt;span style="text-decoration: underline;"&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Senior Global Advertising Manager&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node="1"&gt;​​Join us in our mission to transform the way people shop and eat, where impact, innovation, and growth drive everything we do. Our Advertising team sits at the intersection of commerce, data and marketing helping restaurant and grocery partners accelerate growth through smart, insight-led media solutions. From shaping high-impact campaign strategies to optimising performance at scale, we combine commercial acumen with deep marketplace insight to unlock value for our partners while driving sustainable revenue growth for Deliveroo.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node="2"&gt;We’re looking for a Senior Global Advertising Manager to join our London team. This is a hybrid role. In this role, you’ll help us craft and execute advertising strategies that exceed the needs of our restaurant partners and drive quarterly growth, both directly with key partners and at scale through enabling and leading global commercial teams.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3 data-path-to-node="4"&gt;&lt;span style="text-decoration: underline;"&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You’ll Be Doing&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node="5"&gt;You’ll be joining the Ads and Account Management team. We focus on building deep partnerships, enabling commercial teams, and crafting tailored media strategies to accelerate partner growth across our marketplace.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node="6"&gt;Here’s what your day-to-day might look like:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul data-path-to-node="7"&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node="7,0,0"&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node="7,0,0" data-index-in-node="0"&gt;Identify Data-Led Opportunities:&lt;/strong&gt; Proactively identify scope to increase advertising penetration and spend using a combination of data analytics and commercial insight.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node="7,1,0"&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node="7,1,0" data-index-in-node="0"&gt;Develop Processes &amp;amp; Go-To-Market Programs:&lt;/strong&gt; Originating programs and reporting frameworks that organise commercial teams behind key opportunities to track progress effectively.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node="7,2,0"&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node="7,2,0" data-index-in-node="0"&gt;Enable Teams &amp;amp; Build Playbooks:&lt;/strong&gt; Build playbooks, training, and go-to-market materials that equip global commercial and account management teams to maximise advertising revenue.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node="7,3,0"&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node="7,3,0" data-index-in-node="0"&gt;People &amp;amp; Team Leadership:&lt;/strong&gt; Manage, coach, and support team members, setting clear goals and fostering a culture of high performance and professional growth.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node="7,4,0"&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node="7,4,0" data-index-in-node="0"&gt;Partner Strategy &amp;amp; Campaign Management:&lt;/strong&gt; Work directly with major restaurant partners to understand marketing objectives, propose tailored ad solutions, and coordinate campaign launches, management, and reporting.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node="7,5,0"&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node="7,5,0" data-index-in-node="0"&gt;Performance Monitoring &amp;amp; Optimisation:&lt;/strong&gt; Proactively monitor campaign performance, identifying, communicating, and resolving any issues to exceed partner objectives.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node="7,6,0"&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node="7,6,0" data-index-in-node="0"&gt;Shape Product Solutions:&lt;/strong&gt; Act as the voice of our partners to feed structured feedback back into internal teams, informing how we iterate and build improved advertising and reporting products.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3 data-path-to-node="9"&gt;&lt;span style="text-decoration: underline;"&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You’ll Need to Thrive&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;h3 data-path-to-node="10"&gt;Essential&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul data-path-to-node="11"&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node="11,0,0"&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node="11,0,0" data-index-in-node="0"&gt;Commercial Advertising Experience:&lt;/strong&gt; Significant experience in commercially focused roles, with a strong background in performance advertising or account management.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node="11,1,0"&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node="11,1,0" data-index-in-node="0"&gt;People Leadership &amp;amp; Management:&lt;/strong&gt; Proven ability to manage, coach, and develop team members, driving high engagement and performance against commercial targets.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node="11,2,0"&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node="11,2,0" data-index-in-node="0"&gt;Strategy &amp;amp; Process Scaling:&lt;/strong&gt; Demonstrated capability in defining, launching, and scaling go-to-market strategies and operational processes across teams.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node="11,3,0"&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node="11,3,0" data-index-in-node="0"&gt;Stakeholder Management:&lt;/strong&gt; Exceptional relationship-building skills with a proven ability to work effectively and build trusted relationships with multiple internal and external partners.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node="11,4,0"&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node="11,4,0" data-index-in-node="0"&gt;Analytical &amp;amp; Innovative Thinking:&lt;/strong&gt; Highly analytical mindset with strong capability to interpret data and turn findings into strategic commercial recommendations.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3 data-path-to-node="12"&gt;Nice to Have&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul data-path-to-node="13"&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node="13,0,0"&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node="13,0,0" data-index-in-node="0"&gt;Digital Marketing &amp;amp; Marketplace Experience:&lt;/strong&gt; Prior exposure to digital marketing environments, e-commerce, or aggregator platforms.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3 data-path-to-node="15"&gt;&lt;span style="text-decoration: underline;"&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Why Join Us?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node="16"&gt;At Deliveroo, you’ll do work that matters, solving real-world problems in a three-sided marketplace that’s constantly evolving. We’re food lovers, problem solvers, community builders and more, brought together by a shared drive to make things better. Working here you can expect to:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node="17"&gt;🔧 &lt;strong data-path-to-node="17" data-index-in-node="3"&gt;Make a visible impact every day&lt;/strong&gt; Your work directly improves experiences for customers, partners and riders.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node="18"&gt;🌱 &lt;strong data-path-to-node="18" data-index-in-node="3"&gt;Learn fast in an entrepreneurial environment&lt;/strong&gt; Work close to the market with autonomy, pace and real responsibility.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node="19"&gt;🧠 &lt;strong data-path-to-node="19" data-index-in-node="3"&gt;Build a career, not just a role&lt;/strong&gt; Stretch yourself, develop new skills and grow as the business evolves.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node="20"&gt;🌎 &lt;strong data-path-to-node="20" data-index-in-node="3"&gt;Deliver together in an inclusive culture&lt;/strong&gt; Collaborative, values-driven teams that support how you work best.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p id="p-rc_eedd860bc4ce1e7d-100" data-path-to-node="21"&gt;We aim to create a fair process that lets your skills shine—our &lt;span class="citation-394 citation-395 citation-end-395"&gt;interview typically includes 3-4 stages. Find more about how we hire here.&lt;sup class="superscript" data-turn-source-index="1"&gt;&lt;/sup&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="citation-394 citation-end-394"&gt;&lt;sup class="superscript" data-turn-source-index="2"&gt;&lt;/sup&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3 data-path-to-node="21"&gt;&lt;span style="text-decoration: underline;"&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span class="citation-392 citation-393 citation-end-393"&gt;Our Global Structure&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node="21"&gt;&lt;span class="citation-392 citation-393 citation-end-393"&gt;&lt;span class="citation-390 citation-391 citation-end-391"&gt;Deliveroo is now part of DoorDash, bringing together teams with even greater reach, scale, and ambition. Depending on your role, you may collaborate with teammates, systems, and leaders across Do&lt;sup class="superscript" data-turn-source-index="5"&gt;&lt;/sup&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="citation-390 citation-end-390"&gt;orDash and Wolt. Together,&lt;sup class="superscript" data-turn-source-index="6"&gt;&lt;/sup&gt;&lt;/span&gt; we’re &lt;span class="citation-389 citation-end-389"&gt;unlocking new possibilities as one global team.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class="source-inline-chip-container luminous-sources ng-star-inserted"&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3 id="p-rc_eedd860bc4ce1e7d-101" data-path-to-node="22"&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class="content-conclusion"&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Diversity, Equity and Inclusion&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;At Deliveroo, we know that a great workplace reflects the world around us and that true diversity and inclusion make us stronger, more creative, and better at what we do. We’re committed to fostering an environment where everyone can do their best work and feel they belong.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We believe in equality of opportunity and welcome candidates from all backgrounds regardless of age, gender, ethnicity, disability, sexual orientation, gender identity, socio-economic background, religion, or belief.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If you have a disability or long-term health condition and need support to apply for one of our roles, or require any reasonable adjustments during the recruitment process, you’ll have the opportunity to let us know once you’ve submitted your application. We’ll share details on how to request support so we can ensure you have a fair and equitable experience.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If you’re excited about making a real impact in a fast-moving marketplace and growing your career alongside ambitious, supportive teams, we’d love to hear from you!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em data-renderer-mark="true"&gt;&lt;br&gt;Beware of recruitment scams: DASH Brands will never ask you to pay money or share sensitive financial information during hiring — learn more about DASH Brands' legitimate recruiting process at&lt;/em&gt; &lt;a class="_ymio1r31 _ypr0glyw _zcxs1o36 _mizu194a _1ah3dkaa _ra3xnqa1 _128mdkaa _1cvmnqa1 _4davt94y _4bfu18uv _1hms8stv _ajmmnqa1 _vchhusvi _kqswh2mm _2rkolb4i _ect4ttxp _syaz13af _1a3b18uv _4fpr8stv _5goinqa1 _f8pj13af _9oik18uv _1bnxglyw _jf4cnqa1 _30l313af _1nrm18uv _c2waglyw _1iohnqa1 _9h8h12zz _10531ra0 _1ien1ra0 _n0fx1ra0 _1vhv17z1" href="http://careersatdoordash.com/recruitment-scam-awareness" data-renderer-mark="true" data-is-router-link="false" data-testid="link-with-safety"&gt;&lt;em data-renderer-mark="true"&gt;careersatdoordash.com/recruitment-scam-awareness&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;em data-renderer-mark="true"&gt;.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk/english-speaking-jobs" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">English Speaking Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</p>

arbeitnow:senior-front-end-engineer-quan:
&lt;div class="content-intro"&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About IonQ:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;u&gt;&lt;a href="https://cts.businesswire.com/ct/CT?id=smartlink&amp;amp;url=https%3A%2F%2Fionq.com%2F&amp;amp;esheet=54451094&amp;amp;newsitemid=20260316477473&amp;amp;lan=en-US&amp;amp;anchor=IonQ%2C+Inc&amp;amp;index=7&amp;amp;md5=0818ffbedc6dbad8c4d1611ac94c2a0f" target="_blank"&gt;IonQ, Inc&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/u&gt;. [NYSE: IONQ] is the world’s leading quantum platform and merchant supplier - delivering integrated quantum solutions across computing, networking, sensing, and security. IonQ’s newest generation of quantum computers, the IonQ Tempo, is the latest in a line of cutting-edge systems that have been helping customers and partners including &lt;u&gt;&lt;a href="https://cts.businesswire.com/ct/CT?id=smartlink&amp;amp;url=https%3A%2F%2Fionq.com%2Fnews%2Fionq-speeds-quantum-accelerated-drug-development-application-with&amp;amp;esheet=54451094&amp;amp;newsitemid=20260316477473&amp;amp;lan=en-US&amp;amp;anchor=Amazon+Web+Services%2C&amp;amp;index=8&amp;amp;md5=a7f94ee9b71a392dca3cd6c413722e51" target="_blank"&gt;Amazon Web Services, &lt;/a&gt;&lt;/u&gt;&lt;u&gt;&lt;a href="https://cts.businesswire.com/ct/CT?id=smartlink&amp;amp;url=https%3A%2F%2Fionq.com%2Fnews%2Fionq-speeds-quantum-accelerated-drug-development-application-with&amp;amp;esheet=54451094&amp;amp;newsitemid=20260316477473&amp;amp;lan=en-US&amp;amp;anchor=and&amp;amp;index=9&amp;amp;md5=2bed627b388878763f41ffe0e4edb16c" target="_blank"&gt;and &lt;/a&gt;&lt;/u&gt;&lt;u&gt;&lt;a href="https://cts.businesswire.com/ct/CT?id=smartlink&amp;amp;url=https%3A%2F%2Fionq.com%2Fnews%2Fionq-speeds-quantum-accelerated-drug-development-application-with&amp;amp;esheet=54451094&amp;amp;newsitemid=20260316477473&amp;amp;lan=en-US&amp;amp;anchor=AstraZeneca&amp;amp;index=10&amp;amp;md5=757c1f2c2ec94cf3982700106122164f" target="_blank"&gt;AstraZeneca&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/u&gt; achieve 20x performance results and accelerate innovation in drug discovery, materials science, financial modeling, logistics, cybersecurity, and defense. In 2025, the company achieved 99.99% two-qubit gate fidelity, &lt;u&gt;&lt;a href="https://cts.businesswire.com/ct/CT?id=smartlink&amp;amp;url=https%3A%2F%2Fionq.com%2Fnews%2Fionq-achieves-landmark-result-setting-new-world-record-in-quantum-computing&amp;amp;esheet=54451094&amp;amp;newsitemid=20260316477473&amp;amp;lan=en-US&amp;amp;anchor=setting+a+world+record+in+quantum+computing+performance&amp;amp;index=11&amp;amp;md5=32e9cb88afbd439026a352666cc72c91" target="_blank"&gt;setting a world record in quantum computing performance&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/u&gt;.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Headquartered in College Park, Maryland, IonQ has operations in California, Colorado, Massachusetts, Tennessee, Washington, Italy, South Korea, Sweden, Switzerland, Canada, and the United Kingdom. Our quantum computing services are available through all major cloud providers, while we also meet the needs of networking and sensing customers across land, sea, air, and space. IonQ is making quantum platforms more accessible and impactful than ever before. &amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Location:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;Oxford, England, UK&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Working pattern:&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;Hybrid, two days per week on site (minimum)&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Role:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are looking for a Senior Front-End Engineer to join our Quantum Tools software team at IonQ. In this role, you will be responsible for designing, developing and supporting web based tools for scientific research and hardware integration for use by our teams of quantum scientists and engineers to enable their work on our research and development goals as an organisation.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Your role will be to shape best in class UX/UI that sets the standard across IonQ. This will directly contribute to our core mission of building, operating and supporting the world's most powerful quantum computers.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Responsibilities:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;In this position, you will work on building a number of different tools for our teams, including information dense dashboard, system telemetry and calibration, amongst others. You will need to create tools capable of managing complex states in a data intensive application environment, supporting the effective delivery of quantum tooling for the next gen platforms.&amp;nbsp;You’ll have the opportunity to deepen your understanding of complex systems, design features end to end that directly impact users, contributing directly to the success of the project.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Key responsibilities include:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Working on developing scientific software and hardware control interfaces for use by teams across IonQ.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Adhering to and setting strict testing discipline.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Liaising with users from a range of cross-functional backgrounds to gather requirements for tools and gain a better understanding of workflows.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Designing and implementing web based tooling.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work as part of the wider quantum tools and software team to embed best practice and stronger processes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Requirements:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;To be successful in this role, you will require prior experience in front-end development, including working with Typescript, HTML, CSS and React. We are looking for someone who can work across teams, turn abstract workflow into a concrete graphical tool working closely with backend engineers and contribute effectively within a fast moving, highly technical team.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You’d be a great fit with:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deep experience in a modern framework such as React, Vue, Svelte or Solid.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience building interfaces around streaming data, including handling frequent updates, subscriptions, connection failures and clear system-status feedback.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience building interactive charts and working with large datasets.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;The ability to diagnose rendering bottlenecks and reason about plot update frequency, virtualisation, and SVG, Canvas and WebGL trade-offs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Sound interaction and visual design judgement for information-dense operator tools, including information hierarchy, accessibility and keyboard workflows.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Benefits:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Be part of a team that’s shaping the future of quantum. We offer more than just a role, you’ll join a world class community of scientists, engineers and innovators working to unlock the full potential of quantum computing.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We offer a range of benefits, including opportunities to further your career alongside industry leaders, a competitive salary with IonQ stock options, an annual performance bonus, generous annual leave, flexible hybrid working, private medical and dental insurance for you and your family, and much more.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Join us and be part of the future of quantum computing.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We’re proud to be an equal opportunity employer and welcome applicants from all backgrounds.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class="content-conclusion"&gt;&lt;p&gt;Compensation will vary based on individual factors such as education, qualifications, and experience of the final candidate(s), specific office location, and calibration against relevant market data and internal team equity. Posted base salary figures are subject to change as new market data becomes available. Our benefits include comprehensive medical, dental, and vision plans, matching 401(k), unlimited PTO and paid holidays, parental/adoption leave, legal insurance, and a home technology stipend. Details of participation in these benefit plans will be provided when a candidate receives an offer of employment.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At IonQ, we believe in fair treatment, access, opportunity, and advancement for all while striving to identify and eliminate barriers. We empower employees to thrive by fostering a culture of autonomy, productivity, and respect. We are dedicated to creating an environment where individuals can feel welcomed, respected, supported, and valued.&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;We are committed to equity and justice. We welcome different voices and viewpoints and do not discriminate on the basis of race, religion, ancestry, physical and/or mental disability, medical condition, genetic information, marital status, sex, gender, gender identity, gender expression, transgender status, age, sexual orientation, military or veteran status, or any other basis protected by law. We are proud to be an Equal Employment Opportunity employer.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;US Technical Jobs.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;The position you are applying for will require access to technology that is subject to U.S. export control and government contract restrictions.&amp;nbsp; Employment with IonQ is contingent on either verifying “U.S. Person” (e.g., U.S. citizen, U.S. national, U.S. permanent resident, or lawfully admitted into the U.S. as a refugee or granted asylum) status for export controls and government contracts work, obtaining any necessary license, and/or confirming the availability of a license exception under U.S. export controls.&amp;nbsp; Please note that in the absence of confirming you are a U.S. Person for export control and government contracts work purposes, IonQ may choose not to apply for a license or decline to use a license exception (if available) for you to access export-controlled technology that may require authorization, and similarly, you may not qualify for government contracts work that requires U.S. Persons, and IonQ may decline to proceed with your application on those bases alone.&amp;nbsp; Accordingly, we will have some additional questions regarding your immigration status that will be used for export control and compliance purposes, and the answers will be reviewed by compliance personnel to ensure compliance with federal law.&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;US Non-Technical Jobs.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;Due to applicable export control laws and regulations, candidates must be a U.S. citizen or national, U.S. permanent resident (i.e., current Green Card holder), or lawfully admitted into the U.S. as a refugee or granted asylum. Accordingly, we will have some additional questions regarding your immigration status that will be used for export control and compliance purposes, and the answers will be reviewed by compliance personnel to ensure compliance with federal law.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If you are interested in being a part of our team and mission, we encourage you to apply!&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</p>

arbeitnow:senior-partner-agent-architect:
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Parloa&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Parloa’s mission is to make every customer conversation feel effortless for both customers and the companies serving them. As agentic AI accelerates, Parloans are shaping the foundation of a new era in customer experience - one where customer support is no longer transactions, but meaningful exchanges. It is not just a vision; Parloa has powered over ONE BILLION interactions between global enterprise brands and their customers, with companies like Booking.com, HealthEquity, Allianz, SAP, BarmeniaGothaer, and TUI already deploying Parloa at scale.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the role:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a&lt;strong&gt; Sr Partner Agent Architect&lt;/strong&gt; at Parloa, you will operate at the intersection of enterprise solution architecture, conversational AI, and partner enablement, helping strategic partners and enterprise customers design, implement, and scale AI-driven customer experiences.&amp;nbsp;This is a highly consultative, customer-facing role where you will guide partners and clients through solution discovery, end-to-end solution architecture, enterprise integration design, conversational architecture, and implementation strategy for enterprise AI Agents. You will design how Parloa’s platform integrates into complex enterprise environments, solve multi-system integration challenges, and apply systems thinking to build reliable, scalable AI solutions.&amp;nbsp;While you bring strong technical depth and can build when needed, your primary focus will be helping partners shape the right technical solutions, architect scalable integrations, prioritize effectively, and successfully operationalize Parloa’s platform within complex enterprise environments.&amp;nbsp;You will also help shape the conversational experience layer by translating customer requirements into AI Agent behavior through prompt engineering, LLM concepts, and conversational design. Prior conversational design experience is valuable but can be further developed on the job.&amp;nbsp;You will work closely with strategic partners, enterprise customers, Partner Success Managers, Technical Program Managers, Forward Deployed Engineers, Solution Engineers, and the broader Agent Architect organization to drive successful AI deployments and long-term customer value.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is your opportunity to shape how enterprise organizations and global partners adopt agentic AI at scale while acting as a trusted advisor across both business and technical stakeholders.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Areas of ownership:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Scope and design end-to-end AI Agent deployments across complex enterprise environments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Define how Parloa integrates with systems such as CRMs, ERPs, ticketing platforms, contact center technologies, and other enterprise applications.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Apply systems thinking to solve complex multi-system data flows, dependencies, and integration challenges.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Guide partners and customers on API design, authentication, data transformation, field mapping, error handling, and integration patterns.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build, configure, test, or troubleshoot integrations using REST APIs, webhooks, JSON/XML payloads, and tools such as Postman.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate with Forward Deployed Engineers on complex or custom integration scenarios beyond standard platform capabilities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead technical discovery workshops, architecture reviews, and solution design sessions with partner and customer stakeholders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Translate customer workflows and business requirements into structured conversational components and reliable AI Agent behavior.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Apply knowledge of LLMs, prompting strategies, embeddings, and context management to improve agent performance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support prompt design, conversational flows, guardrails, escalation logic, and voice configuration such as SSML, lexicons, and regex.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Apply structured testing to validate architecture, integration reliability, agent quality, and real-world behavior.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Review partner-created solution designs and help partners build the capability to deliver Parloa solutions independently.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identify and resolve delivery blockers with Product, Solution Engineering, Forward Deployed Engineering, Customer Success, and partner teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Document reusable architecture patterns, implementation guidance, technical standards, and best practices.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What Success Looks Like&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partners and customers trust you as a strategic and technical advisor.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner-led deployments launch with scalable architectures, reliable integrations, and strong AI Agent performance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partners become increasingly self-sufficient while maintaining high delivery quality and alignment with Parloa standards.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Technical risks, integration gaps, and implementation blockers are identified and resolved early.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Reusable technical guidance and architecture patterns improve delivery quality across the partner ecosystem.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who you are:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;4+ years of experience in enterprise customer-facing technical roles across solution architecture, systems architecture, enterprise integration, technical consulting, or complex SaaS implementation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working with strategic partners, systems integrators, consulting firms, or partner-led delivery models.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong systems thinking and experience solving complex problems across multiple systems and data sources.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with enterprise SaaS platforms such as CRMs, ERPs, ticketing systems, contact center platforms, or workflow tools.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proficiency in REST APIs, JSON/XML, API testing tools such as Postman, and authentication patterns including OAuth, API keys, and JWT.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience reading API documentation, defining field mappings, and troubleshooting integration behavior.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to evaluate technical feasibility, architecture quality, scalability, security, and delivery risk.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfort working hands-on with integrations, configuration, testing, and troubleshooting.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong understanding of LLMs, prompt engineering, conversational architecture, and enterprise AI workflows.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to translate customer requirements into reliable prompts, conversational flows, and agent behaviors.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong stakeholder and project management skills, with experience leading workshops, discovery sessions, or architecture discussions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent communication and consultative problem-solving skills across technical and non-technical audiences.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Entrepreneurial mindset, strong initiative, and comfort operating in an evolving environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent written and spoken English is required&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Nice to have:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience enabling systems integrators or technical delivery partners.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Exposure to contact center, telephony, or enterprise CX technologies.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with integration platforms such as MuleSoft, Boomi, Workato, or SAP Integration Suite.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with embeddings, tool calling, retrieval, or agent orchestration.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with SSML, lexicons, regex, or voice configuration.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Exposure to TypeScript, Node.js, Git, CI/CD, cloud infrastructure, or Kubernetes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience supporting enterprise go-lives and production troubleshooting.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Our Recruiting Process:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Talent Acquisition → Hiring Manager → Technical &amp;amp; Expert Interview(s) → Bar Raiser&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Why Parloa?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We're at the beginning of a new era in customer experience, one where AI doesn't just respond, but understands, reasons, and takes action. We're building agentic AI that enterprises trust with their most important customer moments: complex questions, high volumes, real stakes. When millions of people reach out to a brand, those interactions aren't just support tickets; they're defining experiences. We're here to raise the standard: making every conversation seamless, intelligent, and genuinely helpful. If you care about shaping how businesses and customers connect at scale and want your work to matter in real, everyday moments, this is where you do it.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Parloa, ownership isn't a buzzword; it means being accountable for outcomes, not just tasks. We operate in a category that's evolving fast, where the bar is high, and the problems are complex. We hire people who think in solutions, communicate with clarity, and follow through. People who are comfortable making decisions, taking responsibility, and raising the standard for themselves and those around them.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We've grown beyond the earliest startup phase, but we've kept the intensity: fast execution, direct feedback, and a strong expectation to contribute meaningfully from day one.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Backed by leading global investors like General Catalyst, EQT Ventures, and Altimeter Capital, we're scaling with a clear ambition: to become the global category leader in enterprise-grade conversational AI.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class="content-conclusion"&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;iframe style="display: table; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto;" src="https://www.youtube.com/embed/P4d-iyx7RQM" width="560" height="314"&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;hr&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Parloa is committed to upholding the highest data protection standards for our clients' and employees' data. All our employees are instrumental in ensuring the utmost care, GDPR, and ISO compliance, including ISO 27001, in handling sensitive information.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Parloa is an e-verify employer in the USA. &lt;a class="c-link" href="https://www.e-verify.gov/about-e-verify/what-is-e-verify" target="_blank" data-stringify-link="https://www.e-verify.gov/about-e-verify/what-is-e-verify" data-sk="tooltip_parent"&gt;Please click here to learn more&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;* &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;We provide equal opportunities to all qualified applicants regardless race, gender, sexual orientation, age, religion, national origin, disability status, socioeconomic background and other characteristics.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk/english-speaking-jobs" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">English Speaking Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</p>

arbeitnow:software-engineer-platform-lon:
&lt;p&gt;The mission of Speechify is to make sure that reading is never a barrier to learning.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Over 50 million people use Speechify’s text-to-speech products to turn whatever they’re reading – PDFs, books, Google Docs, news articles, websites – into audio, so they can read faster, read more, and remember more. Speechify’s text-to-speech reading products include its iOS app, Android App, Mac App, Chrome Extension, and Web App.&amp;nbsp;Google recently named Speechify the Chrome Extension of the Year and Apple named Speechify its 2025 Design Award winner for Inclusivity.&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Today, nearly 200 people around the globe work on Speechify in a 100% distributed setting – Speechify has no office.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Overview&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="text-align: left;" data-speechify-sentence=""&gt;The Platform team owns the backend behind everything Speechify ships: the public TTS API,&amp;nbsp;payments, subscriptions, auth, consumption tracking, and analytics — serving over 50&amp;nbsp;million users across iOS, Android, Mac, Chrome, and web.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="text-align: left;" data-speechify-sentence=""&gt;These are systems where correctness compounds. Subscription state has to stay consistent&amp;nbsp;across five clients and two app-store billing systems that each go quiet at the worst moment.&amp;nbsp;Consumption metering has to be exact enough to bill on and cheap enough to run at our&amp;nbsp;request volume. The public TTS API has external customers with their own products&amp;nbsp;depending on our latency and uptime. None of this degrades gracefully — it is either right, or&amp;nbsp;someone gets charged twice.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-speechify-sentence=""&gt;The job is to make your own job smaller. Every system you own here should need less of&amp;nbsp;you a year from now than it did the day you took it, and the reward for that is a larger one.&amp;nbsp;That is the entire growth path on this team — there is no separate ladder, and no ceiling&amp;nbsp;except the one you stop raising. We are a flat organization: people become leaders here by&amp;nbsp;taking scope and being right about it, fast.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What Yo&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;u’&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;ll Do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li data-speechify-sentence=""&gt;Design, build, and own the APIs behind payments, subscriptions, auth, consumption&amp;nbsp;tracking, and our public TTS API&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-speechify-sentence=""&gt;Take on services you didn't write and make them faster, cheaper, and harder to break&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-speechify-sentence=""&gt;Establish that a change is correct before it ships, and leave behind the checks that keep it&amp;nbsp;correct after you've moved on&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-speechify-sentence=""&gt;Automate the parts of your role that shouldn't need a person, then go take on what that&amp;nbsp;freed you up for&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-speechify-sentence=""&gt;Turn work you've done once into work the whole team can repeat&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-speechify-sentence=""&gt;Design B2B and enterprise integrations for customers building on top of us&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-speechify-sentence=""&gt;Work with product, mobile, and web to keep backend architecture ahead of where the&amp;nbsp;product is going&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;An Ideal Candidate Should Have&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven backend experience in TS/Node (required)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Direct experience with GCP; working knowledge of AWS, Azure, or another cloud&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A habit of giving away work you used to own, and something to show for the room it&amp;nbsp;created&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A daily working setup with AI agents you can describe in detail — what runs unattended,&amp;nbsp;what you review, and where you've decided it doesn't get to act alone&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;The instinct to check a result against the system itself — logs, database state, the actual&amp;nbsp;request — rather than against a summary of it&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Judgment about what not to build, and the ability to say plainly why you dropped it&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A preference for being corrected over being right&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Preferred: Docker and containerized deployments&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Preferred: deploying high-availability applications on Kubernetes&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Interview process&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Several technical interviews plus a take-home assessment on a real codebase. We aim to&amp;nbsp;finish within a week.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The assessment runs in two stages: you'll submit, get real feedback from an engineer on this&amp;nbsp;team, and have time to act on it. Use the tools you use every day. You'll be asked to walk&amp;nbsp;through your reasoning, so bring it.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-speechify-sentence=""&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What We Offer &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A dynamic environment where your contributions shape the company and its products&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A team that values innovation, intuition, and drive&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Autonomy, fostering focus and creativity&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;The opportunity to have a significant impact in a revolutionary industry&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Competitive compensation, a welcoming atmosphere, and a commitment to an exceptional asynchronous work culture&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;The privilege of working on a product that changes lives, particularly for those with learning differences like dyslexia, ADD, and more&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;An active role at the intersection of artificial intelligence and audio – a rapidly evolving tech domain&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Think you’re a good fit for this job?&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Tell us more about yourself and why you're interested in the role when you apply. &lt;br&gt;And don’t forget to include links to your portfolio and LinkedIn.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Not looking but know someone who would make a great fit?&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Refer them!&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Speechify is committed to a diverse and inclusive workplace.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Speechify does not discriminate on the basis of race, national origin, gender, gender identity, sexual orientation, protected veteran status, disability, age, or other legally protected status.&lt;/p&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk/english-speaking-jobs" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">English Speaking Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</p>

