&lt;p data-path-to-node="5"&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node="5" data-index-in-node="0"&gt;About Us:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p id="p-rc_f8e923bbc18c0cc5-181" data-path-to-node="6"&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node="6,0"&gt;Ranked in 2024 by the Financial Times, Moniepoint is Africa’s fastest growing fintech, trusted by over &lt;strong data-path-to-node="6,0" data-index-in-node="103"&gt;10 million business and individual accounts&lt;/strong&gt;, processing &lt;strong data-path-to-node="6,0" data-index-in-node="159"&gt;billions of Naira’s in transactions monthly&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node="6,2"&gt;. Our mission is to enable financial happiness for every African, everywhere&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node="6,4"&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node="8"&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node="8" data-index-in-node="0"&gt;About this role:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p id="p-rc_f8e923bbc18c0cc5-182" data-path-to-node="9"&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node="9,0"&gt;We are looking for a talented Illustrator to create original pieces of artwork for Moniepoint products&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node="9,2"&gt;. You will work as part of our User Experience, digital &amp;amp; creative team&lt;span class="citation-75 citation-end-75"&gt;, interpreting complex briefs and developing inspiring artwork that will attract our target audience&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node="9,4"&gt;&lt;span class="citation-74 citation-end-74"&gt;. You will be responsible for formulating concepts and rendering draft illustrations from written w&lt;/span&gt;ords, models, sketched ideas, and from your imagination&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node="9,6"&gt;. Ultimately, we are hiring a creative individual who can turn concepts into artistic marketable images&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node="9,8"&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node="11"&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node="11" data-index-in-node="0"&gt;Responsibilities:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul data-path-to-node="12"&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p id="p-rc_f8e923bbc18c0cc5-183" data-path-to-node="12,0,0"&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node="12,0,0,0"&gt;Prepare rough draft illustrations according to requirements and the company’s specifications and needs&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node="12,0,0,2"&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p id="p-rc_f8e923bbc18c0cc5-184" data-path-to-node="12,1,0"&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node="12,1,0,0"&gt;Create complete illustrations and refine design concepts using a wide range of colors, graphics, effects, and illustration software&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node="12,1,0,2"&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p id="p-rc_f8e923bbc18c0cc5-185" data-path-to-node="12,2,0"&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node="12,2,0,0"&gt;Apply isometric techniques to add perspective to complex visual shapes&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node="12,2,0,2"&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p id="p-rc_f8e923bbc18c0cc5-186" data-path-to-node="12,3,0"&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node="12,3,0,0"&gt;Ensure that all digital illustrations meet high quality and color standards&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node="12,3,0,2"&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p id="p-rc_f8e923bbc18c0cc5-187" data-path-to-node="12,4,0"&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node="12,4,0,0"&gt;Brainstorm with the design team to come up with new creative ideas, patterns, visual styles, and concepts&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node="12,4,0,2"&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p id="p-rc_f8e923bbc18c0cc5-188" data-path-to-node="12,5,0"&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node="12,5,0,0"&gt;Stay up-to-date with emerging design techniques, industry trends, and graphics software&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node="12,5,0,2"&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node="14"&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node="14" data-index-in-node="0"&gt;Experience &amp;amp; Background:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul data-path-to-node="15"&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p id="p-rc_f8e923bbc18c0cc5-189" data-path-to-node="15,0,0"&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node="15,0,0,0"&gt;Bachelor's degree in fine arts, design, visual arts, or a related field&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node="15,0,0,2"&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p id="p-rc_f8e923bbc18c0cc5-190" data-path-to-node="15,1,0"&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node="15,1,0,0"&gt;At least 4-5 years of proven work experience as an Illustrator, Graphic Designer, or similar visual design role&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node="15,1,0,2"&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
